    NEXT(["Required next step<br>Find out what people are actually spending money on"])
    CORE{{"CORE PROBLEM<br>I know the solution. The evidence backs me. But the market isn't buying."}}
    ROOT["The problem-solution fit exists. The buying behavior doesn't.<br>DORA says VSM is a force multiplier for AI. The market still isn't buying it."]
    UDE16["UDE-16: AI amplifies existing dysfunction (DORA 2025 + Faros AI)<br>90% adopted AI. Throughput up, but instability up too. Zero effect on burnout."]
    UDE15["UDE-15: Companies fail at delivery but don't fix it<br>They know it. Watch departments fail. Still don't invest."]
    UDE19["UDE-19: Kanban stripped to ceremonies<br>Lost WIP management purpose. Just status reporting."]
    UDE17["UDE-17: AI spend has no visible ROI<br>80% of firms report no productivity impact (DORA 2025)."]
    UDE18["UDE-18: Leaders drowning / burning out<br>40 action items/day. AI has zero effect on burnout (DORA 2025)."]
    UDE20["UDE-20: German market saturated<br>Roles require German. -26% IT postings year-over-year."]
    UDE8["UDE-8: Budgets shifted to AI<br>Learning and consulting cut first. ~2 year trend."]
    UDE11["UDE-11: Macro fear / wars<br>Leaders cut costs, lean out, avoid discretionary spend"]
    UDE9["UDE-9: AI replaces trust in people<br>Free, no pushback, always on, 24/7"]
    UDE10["UDE-10: DevOps interest fading<br>Conferences dying. Category in decline."]
    UDE7["UDE-7: Consulting market contracting<br>Firms laying off. Overall freelance market -20% since 2023."]
    UDE14["UDE-14: Faster delivery pitch is dead<br>Every consultant says it. Trust is low. Undifferentiated."]
    UDE12["UDE-12: VSM is unfamiliar to buyers<br>Nobody searches for it or budgets for it"]
    UDE4["UDE-4: No inbound demand<br>Nobody searching for VSM services"]
    UDE5["UDE-5: Outreach neglected<br>Not enough volume of conversations"]
    UDE6["UDE-6: Messaging doesn't convert<br>Faster delivery is what every consultant says"]
    UDE1["UDE-1: Business not sustainable<br>One paying client in the past year"]

